Dev Weekly #142

Top Stories This Week:

1. Rust 2026 Edition Released
The Rust team announced the 2026 edition with async closures,
improved compile times, and a new borrow checker algorithm.

2. WebGPU Lands in Firefox Stable
Firefox 135 ships with full WebGPU support, completing the
cross-browser availability of the next-gen graphics API.

3. Python 3.15 Beta Available
Notable features include pattern matching guards, improved
error messages, and the new `defer` statement.

Read more at https://devweekly.io/issue/142

